BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 682.8 Tm (Not B: Aortic opening is a left ventricular outflow event.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 669.4 Tm (Not C: Ventricular ejection is not the primary a-wave mechanism.) Tj ET
